# Hetzner Cloud's settings (`metacomputer vm create NAME --on hetzner` writes them to config/vms/NAME.env), as comments:
# nothing here is read as a setting; config/defaults.env has the defaults every computer shares. Its docs: docs/remote.md, Hetzner Cloud, DigitalOcean and Vultr.
#   PLACE=hetzner, PROVIDER=hetzner, TRANSPORT=ssh
#   SIZE                     cax11 (the default), cax21, cax31 (Arm), cx23, cx33 (x86)
#   REGION                   fsn1 (the default), nbg1, hel1
#   IDLE_STOP                minutes unused before it powers itself off (15; off: never): it saves nothing there
#   EGRESS                   internet or off: its own firewall, and its Cloud Firewall outside it
# Its credentials, only from the environment of the command that needs them (never a file):
#   HCLOUD_TOKEN             an API token of the project, read and write
